    <string name="protection_how_title">How protection works</string>
    <string name="protection_how_body">Requests are filtered right at the proxy, so every device on your network gets ads &amp; trackers stripped — no per-device setup, and it works with or without a VPN. Tap any blocked host to allow it if it was caught by mistake.</string>
    <!-- 引导：双模式（有没有 VPN 都能用） -->
    <string name="ob_dual_title">Two ways to use it</string>
    <string name="ob_dual_body">hxmy works with or without a VPN — pick either, and switch anytime.</string>
    <string name="ob_dual_c1_title">🌐 With a VPN — shared egress</string>
    <string name="ob_dual_c1_body">Every device on your network browses through your VPN. One subscription covers your TV, console and laptop.</string>
    <string name="ob_dual_c2_title">🛡️ Without a VPN — filtering gateway</string>
    <string name="ob_dual_c2_body">Turn on ad-block and every device gets ads &amp; trackers stripped right at the proxy — like a Pi-hole, no VPN needed.</string>
